<p>This is the default, and every other style is this with one thing changed. The portrait is right-anchored and masked on its left edge so it belongs to the ground rather than sitting on it; the accent block behind the shoulder is the one colour; the title is five or six words with one of them in the accent; “new film!” is in the hand, tilted, where the eye lands second.</p>
